__pycache__/
*.pyc
# CHANGE (Nov 5): new files in tools/ are not added to git. tools/ holds test
# scripts that run on a computer, not on the hub.
# CHANGE (Nov 13): except the files that save a log of every run. They go into
# git, so every computer gets them. Before, this was "tools/", which kept all
# of tools/ off GitHub.
tools/*
!tools/run_logged.py
!tools/ide/
# CHANGE (Nov 9): the logs folder is never added to git with the code.
# tools/run_logged.py uploads new log files to the logs folder on GitHub by
# itself, without touching the code or any other files.
logs/
